      "replacement": "4. 俄罗斯联邦公民享有平等进入国家公务的机会。"
    },
    {
      "locale": "zh",
      "unitId": "constitution-uc70b8482ce75f7dd37-1",
      "field": "text",
      "status": "pass",
      "replacement": "5. 俄罗斯联邦公民有权参与司法审判。"
    },
    {
      "locale": "zh",
      "unitId": "constitution-ub3b27f8fc27f0cb05a-1",
      "field": "text",
      "status": "pass",
      "replacement": "1. 保障人人获得专业法律帮助的权利。在法律规定的情形下，免费提供法律帮助。"
    },
    {
      "locale": "zh",
      "unitId": "constitution-u573c0470f5f2b925b5-1",
      "field": "text",
      "status": "pass",
      "replacement": "2. 司法审判中不得使用违反联邦法律取得的证据。"
    },
    {
      "locale": "zh",
      "unitId": "constitution-ub196f25be4dd495c98-1",
      "field": "text",
      "status": "pass",
      "replacement": "阿迪格共和国（阿迪格）、阿尔泰共和国、巴什科尔托斯坦共和国、布里亚特共和国、达吉斯坦共和国、顿涅茨克人民共和国<1>、印古什共和国<2>、卡巴尔达—巴尔卡尔共和国、卡尔梅克共和国<3>、卡拉恰伊—切尔克斯共和国、卡累利阿共和国、科米共和国、克里米亚共和国<4>、卢甘斯克人民共和国<5>、马里埃尔共和国、莫尔多维亚共和国、萨哈共和国（雅库特）、北奥塞梯—阿兰共和国<6>、鞑靼斯坦共和国（鞑靼斯坦）、图瓦共和国、乌德穆尔特共和国、哈卡斯共和国、车臣共和国、楚瓦什共和国—楚瓦什<7>；"
    },
    {
      "locale": "zh",
      "unitId": "constitution-u2632ce80a3cda3e07d-1",
      "field": "text",
      "status": "pass",
      "replacement": "1. 俄罗斯联邦依公认的国际法原则和准则及俄罗斯联邦国际条约，保障人口较少的原住民族的权利。"
    },
    {
      "locale": "zh",
      "unitId": "constitution-uf85aa572ab4502adc3-1",
      "field": "text",
      "status": "pass",
      "replacement": "к) 行政、行政程序、劳动、家庭、住房、土地、水、森林立法，以及地下资源和环境保护立法；"
    },
    {
      "locale": "en",
      "unitId": "constitution-u109cee0e55255131f0-1",
      "field": "text",
      "status": "pass",
      "replacement": "л) personnel of judicial and law-enforcement bodies; the bar and the notariat;"
    },
    {
      "locale": "zh",
      "unitId": "constitution-uaa3907b78f623b786e-1",
      "field": "text",
      "status": "pass",
      "replacement": "м) 保护人口较少的族群的原生生活环境和传统生活方式；"
    },
    {
      "locale": "en",
      "unitId": "constitution-u2d0e01100dd715e207-1",
      "field": "text",
      "status": "pass",
      "replacement": "2. A citizen of the Russian Federation aged at least 35, who has permanently resided in the Russian Federation for at least 25 years and does not hold, and has never held, foreign citizenship or a residence permit or other document confirming a citizen of the Russian Federation's right to permanent residence in a foreign State, may be elected President of the Russian Federation. The requirement concerning the absence of foreign citizenship for a candidate for President of the Russian Federation does not apply to citizens of the Russian Federation who previously held citizenship of a State that, or part of which, was admitted to the Russian Federation under federal constitutional law and who permanently resided in the territory of the State or part of the State admitted to the Russian Federation. In the manner established by federal law, the President of the Russian Federation is prohibited from opening or holding accounts (deposits) or keeping cash and valuables in foreign banks located outside the territory of the Russian Federation."
    },
    {
      "locale": "en",
      "unitId": "constitution-ue58bbf9e095288fcdd-1",
      "field": "text",
      "status": "pass",
      "replacement": "2. The State Duma's decision to bring a charge and the Federation Council's decision to remove the President of the Russian Federation from office or deprive a former President of immunity must be adopted by votes of two-thirds of the total membership of the respective chambers — senators of the Russian Federation and deputies of the State Duma — on the initiative of at least one-third of the deputies of the State Duma and with an opinion from a special commission established by the State Duma."
    },
    {
      "locale": "en",
      "unitId": "constitution-u16cd3d2b50e7b8648e-1",
      "field": "text",
      "status": "pass",
      "replacement": "2. If a proposal to revise the provisions of chapters 1, 2 and 9 of the Constitution of the Russian Federation is supported by votes of three-fifths of the total number of members of the Federation Council and deputies of the State Duma, a Constitutional Assembly is convened in accordance with federal constitutional law."
    },
    {
      "locale": "zh",
      "unitId": "constitution-u61850e033f833572d9-1",
      "field": "text",
      "status": "pass",
      "replacement": "3. 制宪会议或者确认维持俄罗斯联邦宪法不变，或者制定新的俄罗斯联邦宪法草案；该草案由制宪会议全体成员三分之二票数通过，或交付全民投票。举行全民投票时，如参加投票的选民超过全体选民半数，且赞成票超过参投选民半数，俄罗斯联邦宪法即视为通过。"
    }
